## 6. Key Features

### 6.1 Prompt-Based Commands

The system understands natural language:

```
# Get latest report
"get latest lre report"
    → Finds newest ZIP
    → Converts to Excel
    → Returns file path

# Process multiple reports
"process latest 3 reports"
    → Finds 3 newest ZIPs
    → Converts all to Excel
    → Returns file paths

# Compare reports
"compare latest 2 reports"
    → Finds 2 newest ZIPs
    → Converts to Excel
    → Merges and adds trends
    → Returns comparison file

# Email reports
"send latest report to user@company.com"
    → Processes report
    → Sends via Outlook
    → Confirms delivery

# Combined operations
"compare latest 2 reports and email to user1@company.com, user2@company.com"
    → All of the above in one command
```

### 6.2 Trend Analysis

Comparison reports include intelligent trend detection:

```
Transaction Performance Comparison

| Transaction | Avg_file1 | Avg_file2 | Trend        |
|-------------|-----------|-----------|--------------|
| Login       | 2.0 ms    | 1.5 ms    | ⬆ Improved   |
| Search      | 1.2 ms    | 1.8 ms    | ⬇ Degraded   |
| Checkout    | 3.0 ms    | 3.0 ms    | ➖ No Change  |

Logic:
- If (latest < previous) → ⬆ Improved
- If (latest > previous) → ⬇ Degraded
- If (latest == previous) → ➖ No Change
```

### 6.3 Safety Mechanisms

```
1. Fallback Path: If user path invalid → use DEFAULT_PATH
2. Validation: Check folder exists before processing
3. Skip Invalid: Skip ZIPs without Report/ folder
4. Email Validation: Verify email format
5. Error Handling: Catch exceptions, return meaningful errors
6. Graceful Degradation: Process what's available, skip what isn't
```

