## 9. Error Handling

### 9.1 Common Errors & Solutions

| Error | Cause | Solution |
|-------|-------|----------|
| `No ZIP files found` | Empty folder | Check DEFAULT_PATH or provide valid path |
| `Report folder not found` | Invalid ZIP structure | Ensure ZIP contains `Report/summary.html` |
| `No recipient email found` | Missing email in prompt | Include email: `email to user@company.com` |
| `Author identity unknown` | Git config not set | Run `git config --global user.email` |
| `Failed to execute git` | No git identity | Set git user name and email |

### 9.2 Error Response

```json
{
  "error": "No ZIP files found"
}
```

